known for its exemplary achievements in providing holistic education. The academic session 2025-26 will mark the completion of 25 glorious years. It is one of the most illustrious CBSE schools in the city. We try to hold on to our objectives of making learning purposeful and enjoyable while creating a safe space for students to nurture and grow. The management takes a keen interest in the welfare and in safeguarding the interests of the members of the DPS&nbsp;community.<\/span>","content_type":"text","image_path":null,"image_url":null,"link_url":null,"video_path":null,"video_url":null,"table_data":null,"accordion_data":null,"order":1,"is_active":true,"created_at":"2025-09-22T05:13:23.940000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T05:13:23.940000Z","page_section_id":"1515","content_heading":null,"alignment":null,"image_alt":null,"column_type":null,"width":"50","image_width":null,"image_height":null,"content_item_id":null,"content_item_type":null}]}]}}